{title: God Is Great (FJ_90_en)}
{subtitle: Gott ist groß}
{song_number: 90}
{language: en}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 162}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C]All creation [F]cries to You, [Gsus4]
[C]worshipping in [F]spirit and in [Gsus4]truth.
[Am7]Glory to the [F]Faithful [Gsus4]One,
[Am7]Jesus [G]Christ, God's [F]Son. [G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]God is great and His [F]praise fills the earth, [G]fills the [F]heavens.
[C]And Your name will be praised [Am7]through all the [Gsus4]world.
[C]God is great, sing His [F]praise all the [G]earth, all the [F]heavens,
'cause we're [Am7]living for the [F]glory of Your [Gsus4]name, the [F]glory of Your [Gsus4]name.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C]All creation [F]gives You praise, [Gsus4]
[C]You alone [F]are truly [Gsus4]great.
[Am7]You alone [F]are God who [Gsus4]reigns
[Am7]for e[G]terni[F]ty. [G]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[C]God is great and His [F]praise fills the earth, [G]fills the [F]heavens.
[C]And Your name will be praised [Am7]through all the [Gsus4]world.
[C]God is great, sing His [F]praise all the [G]earth, all the [F]heavens,
'cause we're [Am7]living for the [F]glory of Your [Gsus4]name, the [F]glory of Your [Gsus4]name.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C]All to You, O [F]God we bring. [Gsus4]
[C]Jesus, teach [F]us how to [Gsus4]live.
[C]Let Your fire [F]burn in us [Gsus4]
[Am7]that all [G]may [F]hear and all may [Gsus4]see.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_bridge}
[C]“Holy [F]is the [Gsus4]Lord,” the [Am7]whole earth sings,
[F]the whole earth [Gsus4]sings.
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Coda}
[Gsus4]'Cause we're [Am7]living for the [F]glory of Your [Gsus4]name,
the [C]glory of Your name.

